      "created_at": "2014-05-28T15:57:24.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>This is mostly a question of timing. In advanced mode Voss gets an extra card play at the end of turn. This of course becomes start of turn with Sub-Zero Atmosphere. Thus when it played a forced deployment it triggered immediatly since it was start of turn. if there was ten minion in the trash would that mean:</p><p>A: immediate defeat because you've been overrunned or:</p><p>B: has the condition already been checked meaning he simply doesn't flip back and immediatly win at that point since it was already checked up and false when it checked up</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:41:25.543Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
